  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building a film database to support decision-making for energy infrastructure in low income housing in India and South Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Research Network focussed on interrelated development challenges of gender equity, energy poverty and infrastructure. Benefits to local populations, advocacy groups, NGOs and policy makers in South Africa and India. SDG 5 7 12</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
